q6 as (insert into public.quiz_questions (quiz_id, question_text, question_type, sort_order) select id, $qz$A hybrid test seeds data via the API and then verifies it in the UI. Which sequencing best avoids a race where the UI loads before the data exists?$qz$, 'multiple_choice', 6 from newq returning id),
